{
  "schema": "atx.research-store-classes/v1",
  "description": "The research-store class registry (P9 SQL2; sql-design section 1 and 3.9). Data the catalog (atx-research-store) and the render-identity checker (atx-engine/tools/research_store_identity.py) read at run time; not a schema generator (ruling SQL-5). Classification: the first class, in this order, one of whose globs matches the lower-cased root-relative path and, for a json class that lists schemas, whose schemas hold the document's top-level schema string; `other` (last) takes the rest. One schema may sit in two classes only when every glob of those classes ends in a literal file name and no file name belongs to two of them (run-start / run-receipt; test_research_store_classes.py). registers: literals a class registers that are not document schemas (not used for classification; the wave-reader). seed_globs: where every catalog walk starts besides the spec globs. legacy_allow: schema literals of non-test code that name no class here, each until its expiry (the guard pytest fails after it). domains: literals that name a digest or document domain, not a file class.",
